  - `other-verbs`, `placer-app`, `decl-graph` (the four not-found verbs' test name, `Placer::App`'s reserved status, the renamed declared-node guard): 0 in the masters — their controls never fired over the seven masters' pre-pass text, the sweep's refusal recorded in the trail the basis of each zero; the sites of the remaining Expected amendments are named by handle in the plan and read by the proposers from their rows;
